ers and investors seeking strong long-term value.<br> <br> With a spacious layout of 724.84 sq. ft. (67.34 sqm), the apartment has been thoughtfully designed to maximize comfort, natural light, and functionality, creating an ideal waterfront lifestyle in one of Dubai's most anticipated master communities.<br> <br> Property Features:<br> <br> 1 Bedroom<br> 1 Bathroom<br> Corner Unit<br> Largest Layout<br> Private Balcony with Lagoon Views<br> Spacious Living and Dining Area<br> Contemporary Design and Premium Finishes<br> Ideal for End-Users and Investors<br> Excellent Potential for Capital Appreciation<br> Strong Rental Yield Prospects<br> Close to the Future Metro Station<br> <br> Community Amenities:<br> <br> Crystal Lagoon and Waterfront Promenade<br> Lagoon-Facing Swimming Pools<br> Retail Boulevard with Cafés and Restaurants<br> Indoor and Outdoor Fitness Facilities<br> Jogging and Cycling Tracks<br> Water Sports Facilities<br> Open-Air Cinema<br> Outdoor Amphitheater<br> Landscaped Gardens and Relaxation Areas<br> Multipurpose Sports Courts<br> Family-Oriented Community Environment<br> <br> Azizi Venice is a landmark waterfront destination in Dubai South, offering a unique blend of resort-style living and urban convenience. Centered around a spectacular crystal lagoon, the community is designed to provide residents with a vibrant lifestyle enriched by leisure, retail, entertainment, and wellness amenities.<br> <br> Strategically positioned near the future Metro station and Al Maktoum International Airport, Azizi Venice enjoys excellent connectivity to Dubai's key destinations while benefiting from the tremendous growth potential of Dubai South. Its prime location, lifestyle appeal, and investment fundamentals make it one of the most attractive opportunities in Dubai's emerging property market.<br> <br> Contact Provident Real Estate today for further details or to arrange a private consultation.","longitude":null,"negotiator_id":"11943","negotiator_mapping":"ry